WEBVTT

00:00.960 --> 00:02.560
Are you sure you're okay?

00:02.860 --> 00:06.380
I'm totally fine! Fully recovered!

00:06.380 --> 00:08.770
And I got lots of sleep, so don't worry.

00:08.770 --> 00:11.000
Well, that's good, then.

00:11.000 --> 00:13.820
Hayato-kun was really worried about you, too.

00:14.740 --> 00:18.760
I've never seen him look so flustered before.

00:19.490 --> 00:20.970
He was that worried?

00:20.970 --> 00:21.870
Yep.

00:22.680 --> 00:23.870
110!

00:24.450 --> 00:26.460
Go call 110!

00:26.460 --> 00:28.170
He really freaked out.

00:28.170 --> 00:31.690
What the heck? What good 
would it do to call the police?

00:32.470 --> 00:33.690
I know, right?

00:33.690 --> 00:35.720
I see... But, you know...

00:36.110 --> 00:38.180
It's not a bad feeling.

00:40.190 --> 00:44.560
Anyway, I guess I should probably 
thank Hayato-kun, huh?

00:44.560 --> 00:46.480
Seems like I had him pretty worried.

00:47.410 --> 00:50.480
Wow, you're a student at Tokyo U?

00:50.480 --> 00:51.500
That's awesome!

00:51.500 --> 00:53.070
I'm on leave right now, though.

00:53.070 --> 00:54.430
That's still amazing.

00:54.430 --> 00:56.080
And you're pretty hot, too.

00:56.080 --> 00:58.300
Hey, give us your contact info!

00:58.300 --> 00:59.490
Let's hang out sometime!

00:59.490 --> 01:00.570
Please?

01:00.570 --> 01:01.740
Uh...

01:02.200 --> 01:04.780
Yes! I'm so sorry!

01:04.780 --> 01:09.040
I'll come take your order right away. 
Please wait at your table.

01:09.040 --> 01:11.590
Riho, are you feeling better now?

01:12.000 --> 01:13.050
Don't work too—

01:13.050 --> 01:15.130
Don't think you can just chat me up!

01:15.130 --> 01:16.560
Naturally wavy-haired jerk!

01:16.560 --> 01:18.700
Huh?!

01:18.700 --> 01:20.640
What's wrong, Hayacchi?

01:21.000 --> 01:24.270
I showed concern for Riho's health, 
and she insulted me.

01:24.740 --> 01:28.320
A woman's heart is 
as fickle as the autumn sky.

01:28.320 --> 01:30.600
It's still the peak of summer, though...

01:47.080 --> 01:49.670
<b></b>The Café Terrace and Its Goddesses

03:01.410 --> 03:03.490
